  "final_answer_text": "The client must initialize the connection (call initialize() for sync clients, or follow the async initialize flow) before invoking APIs such as listTools(), callTool(), listResources(), getResource(), listPrompts(), or executePrompt(). Initialization establishes the MCP session, performs protocol and capability negotiation, and sets up change/notification consumers so subsequent calls behave correctly; skipping it can cause missing capability negotiation, unavailable features, or failed requests.",
